# Chat API

## Route
- Gateway: `/api/chat/{**catch-all}` → `srv-chat`
- Base path: `/api/chat/v1` (scaffold; no business endpoints yet)

## Runtime
- Aspire / local: `http://localhost:5005`
- Docker: host `5005` → container `8080`
- Health: `GET /health`
- Metrics: `GET /metrics`

## Status
- Empty .NET 10 service with Observability, JWT auth wiring, Asp.Versioning + Swagger (Development).
- Add domain controllers under `ChatApiController` when implementing chat features.

## Don't
- Do not call chat HTTP from the frontend without going through nginx → gateway.
